8/20/2026 Todd Carnes:
 * CMakeLists.txt: Created C++23 CMake build system (v0.34) using FetchContent for SDL2 and sdl12-compat bridge. Enforced strict MSVC (/permissive- /W4) and GCC/Clang (-Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic) compilation for Windows, Linux, and macOS parity.
 * Autotools: Removed legacy configure, Makefile.am/in, and helper scripts.
 * IDE: Removed legacy sdlhana.dsp and sdlhana.kdevelop files.
 * Memory Management: Refactored raw new/delete in main.cpp, game.cpp, player.cpp, and general.h to std::unique_ptr and stack RAII allocations.
 * String & Print Formatting: Removed platform vsnprintf macro hacks, replaced fprintf calls with C++23 std::println, and updated va() to thread-local buffer storage.
 * Randomness: Modernized C rand() and modulo math in util.cpp using C++23 <random> (std::mt19937).
 * Metadata: Updated copyright headers across all 20 source files to include Todd Carnes <toddcarnes@gmail.com>.

